zabbix-widget-event-timeline (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added a Drilldown dialog that shows the detailed event list when clicking
    an event bar / stack segment (prototype-group or individual-event level,
    with a host name list).
  * The 7-day bucket's week-start day can now be configured per widget for
    all 7 weekdays (new widgets default to Sunday; existing widgets keep
    Monday).
  * Improved the 30-day-range X-axis date labels to use an evenly spaced
    grid.
  * Adjusted X-axis label overflow, bottom margin, and runtime control row
    wrapping.
  * Fixed the event bar tooltip no longer responding after changing the
    dashboard's displayed time period.
  * Clarified the paging item-count labels (chart body vs. Drilldown) and
    merged the "Detail view" setting into the "Paging" section.
  * Confirmed the automatic bucket-width candidates (1 minute to 1 month)
    intentionally omit a 2-day width; the granularity now jumps from 1 day
    directly to 7 days by design.

 -- claude <noreply@example.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

